{%- comment -%}
  Jasmine Bloom: the brand's artwork rebuilt from independent, complete parts so nothing has holes while it grows
  (from the designer's 1600x1800 PNG; viewBox matches it 1:1):
    sun (rises at the top-right of the flowers) and two birds beside it (glide in, then drift);
    stems: continuous curves drawn up from the soil to each flower, the centre leaf and the bud;
    leaves: whole shapes that unfurl from where they meet their stem;
    flowers on top: plain white petals (no outlines) opening out from each centre, lower flower first; then the bud.
  The plant is lifted 50 units to stand on the shared "hills" ground (swick-frag-ground).
  Animation classes come from snippets/swick-fragrance-art.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
